            <abstract>
                <p>According to this miracle, <persName ref="PRS3429DawitII"><roleName type="title">King</roleName> Dāwit</persName>
                    asked <persName ref="PRS6298Libanos"/> for help with the reconstruction of 
                    <placeName ref="LOC6564MaryamS">the cathedral of ʾAksum</placeName> undertaken in the 29th year of his reign. 
                    The text contains a ‘Prayer of St Libanos’ and a section of the ‘Healing of a woman possessed by three demons, who had become mute’.                 
                    It is transmitted as two miracles in <ref type="mss" corresp="ANLcr26"/>.</p>
            </abstract>
