            <div type="edition">
                <div type="textpart" subtype="incipit">
                    <note>The following incipit is taken from <bibl><ptr target="bm:Bausi2003Libanos"/>
                        <citedRange unit="verse">300–317</citedRange><citedRange unit="page">118–125</citedRange></bibl>.</note>
                    <ab>፳፡ ተኣምሪሁ፡ ለቅዱስ፡ ሊባኖስ፡ ወካዕበ፡ እነግረክሙ፡ ኦፍቁራንየ፡ ዘከመ፡ ጸለየ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ሊባኖስ፡ እንዘ፡ ይብል፡ እግዚኦ፡ ሀበኒ፡ ሠናየ፡ ፍሬ፡ በዘይትአቀባ፡ አብያተ፡ 
                        ክርስቲያናት፡ ምንት፡ ውእቱ፡ ሠናይ፡ ፍሬ፡</ab>
                </div>
                <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="MirLib20partI">
                <div type="textpart" subtype="incipit" xml:id="MirLib20partIinc">
                    <note>The following incipit is taken from <ref type="mss" corresp="ANLcr26"/> according
                        to the catalogue description in <bibl><ptr target="bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue"/>
                            <citedRange unit="item">26, 45</citedRange><citedRange unit="page">98</citedRange></bibl>.</note>
                    <ab xml:lang="gez">ተአምሪሁ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/> ስምዑ፡ እንግርክሙ<supplied
                        reason="omitted">፡</supplied> አበዊነ፡ ቅዱሳን፡ ወአኃውየ፡ ፍቁራን፡ ተአምሪሁ፡
                        ለአቡነ፡ ዓምደ፡ ጽንዕ፡ ዘኢያንቀለቅል፡ ፀወና፡ ለኢትዮጵያ።
                        <gap reason="ellipsis"/><pb n="55v"/><cb n="b"/><gap reason="ellipsis"/>
                        ወአ<pb n="56r"/><cb n="a"/>መ፡
                        ኮነ፡ በ፳ወ፱ ዓመተ፡ መንግሥቱ፡ ለዳዊት፡ መፍቀሬ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ፈነወ፡ እምሊቃውንቲሁ፡ ከመ፡ የሐድሱ፡ ሐኒፆታ፡ 
                        ለአኵስም፡</ab>
                </div>
            </div>
                
                <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="MirLib20partII">
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="incipit" xml:id="MirLib20partIIinc">
                        <note>The following incipit for the second part of the miracle is taken from <ref type="mss" corresp="ANLcr26"/>
                            according to the catalogue description in <bibl><ptr target="bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue"/>
                                <citedRange unit="item">26, 46</citedRange><citedRange unit="page">98</citedRange></bibl>..</note>
                        <ab xml:lang="gez">
                            ወእንዘ፡ ነሐንጽ፡ ዜነዉነ፡ ከመ፡ መጽአት፡ ብእሲት፡ እንተ፡ አሰራ፡ ጋኔን፡ ልሳና፡ ወኢትክል፡ ነቢበ፡
                            ለግሙራ፡ ወይቤሉኒ፡ ተናገረት፡ ርቱዓ፡ ወሖረት፡ ውስተ፡ ቤታ። ወተስእልክዎሙ፡ 
                            ለመነኮሳት<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> ወለአኩ፡ ኀቤሃ፡ ወእቤ፡ ንዒአ፡ ኀቤየአ፡ እስመ፡ ብየአ፡ 
                            ነገርአ፡ ዘእትናገረኪ።
                        </ab>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
